# 行尾統一：入庫與工作樹一律 LF。
# 為什麼：Git for Windows 預設 core.autocrlf=true，clone 後工作樹變 CRLF，
# scripts/check-quote-issuance.js 的變異測試（樣式含 \n）會因「變異樣式找不到」誤報失敗。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 專用啟動腳本維持 CRLF（cmd／WSH 對 LF 行尾的 label、多行括號有已知問題）；入庫內容仍是 LF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf

# 二進位檔：不做任何行尾轉換、不做文字 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
